{% extends "base" %}{% block content %}
<div class="page-heading"><div><h1>仓库镜像</h1><p class="muted">直接查询目标仓库，查看已存在的镜像标签与实际架构。</p></div><a class="button" href="/registries">管理目标仓库</a></div>
<section class="panel"><form id="image-query-form" class="inventory-query"><div><label for="image-registry">目标仓库</label><select id="image-registry" required><option value="">请选择仓库</option></select></div><div class="repository-field"><label for="image-repository">镜像名称 <span class="optional">选填</span></label><input id="image-repository" list="repository-names" placeholder="如 nginx；留空尝试自动发现" maxlength="255"><datalist id="repository-names"></datalist></div><button id="query-images" class="primary" type="submit"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#search"/></svg>查询镜像</button></form><p class="inventory-help">镜像名称不含域名、命名空间或标签。未出现在自动发现列表中的镜像，也可填写名称单独查询。</p></section>
<div id="image-warnings" class="notice warning" role="status" hidden></div>
<section class="panel list-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2 id="image-scope">远端镜像</h2><p id="image-updated" class="panel-caption"></p></div><div class="search-field image-filter"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="/static/icons.svg#search"/></svg><input id="image-search" type="search" placeholder="筛选名称、标签、架构" aria-label="筛选已查询镜像"></div></div><div id="image-list" class="table-wrap"><p class="loading">请选择目标仓库。</p></div><div id="images-pagination" class="pagination" aria-label="分页"></div></section>
{% endblock %}
